                                          └── WAL is durable before commit;
                                              window is documented per class

  WINDOW: bounded and documented. Under saturation, admission refused.

  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  INVARIANT (Theorem 34.1):                                            │
  │  No transaction is marked Absent if its BEGIN record survived.        │
  │  The Indeterminate state means "I do not know", never "it did not     │
  │  happen". Local clinical action may proceed before persistence;       │
  │  persistence is a traceability guarantee, not a precondition.         │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
